# Toolkit.Foundations

Standard definitions and named results that the base libraries (Mathlib, Causalean, …) do not
provide: textbook theorems and well-known lemmas the owner's papers rely on, organised by
mathematical topic in submodules (`Toolkit.Foundations.<Topic>.*`). Definitions live next to
the results that use them. Admission test: statable in base + toolkit vocabulary, a standard or
named result (or a general fact a textbook would state), absent from the base, axiom-clean.
-/

